          "_name": "features4",
          "_sourceTheme": "resultm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features4 resultm5\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n        'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Item Amount\" name=\"cards\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Desc\" name=\"showDesc\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Button\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/p1107004-2000x2667.jpg\" parallax selected>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#000000\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#232323\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 card\">\n                <div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><i><b>Sound Masking Installation</b></i></h2>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5 col-md-6 card\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/p1107003-670x893.jpg\" alt=\"Sound Masking Products Installed\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Seamless Single or Multi-Zone Sound Masking Installation</b></h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\">\n                        Our sound masking installations offer a perfect blend of state-of-the-art technology and customer-centric service. Whether you require a single or multi-zone sound masking installation, our certified technicians ensure seamless deployment. Experience the Viscom Systems difference with a system designed to optimize the acoustic environment while minimizing distraction and enhancing privacy.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-danger-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            See more\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 1\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-1920x1280.jpg\" alt=\"Campus Sound Masking Solutions\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>From Single Building</b><br><b>to Multi-Campus Applications</b></h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\">No project is too big or too small for Viscom Systems. We offer scalable sound masking and paging solutions to cater to any size of operation, from a single building to multi-campus applications. Trust in our commitment to provide fast, courteous, and quality service at every stage, ensuring your project is completed on time and on budget.<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-danger-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            See more\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 2\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/image14.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                        At dolorem nam non voluptates quidem\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\">\n                        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Architecto aspernatur autem cupiditate\n                        distinctio exercitationem fugiat fugit minima nam, nesciunt nobis. Itaque, laboriosam, sequi\n                        accusamus.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-danger-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            See more\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 3\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/image12.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                        Quidem quos ratione reiciendis repellendus\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\">\n                        Adipisicing elit. Aliquid consectetur delectus eum\n                        eveniet illum iure laudantium nemo nesciunt non obcaecati, quidem quos ratione reiciendis\n                        repellendus sapiente ut vel veritatis voluptatem.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-danger-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            See more\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
