              "img": {
                "width": "100%",
                "height": "280px",
                "border-radius": "20px",
                "margin-bottom": "40px",
                "object-fit": "cover",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "height": "250px",
                  "margin-bottom": "24px"
                }
              },
              ".mbr-card-title": {
                "margin-bottom": "20px",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "margin-bottom": "16px"
                }
              },
              ".mbr-desc": {
                "margin-bottom": "24px"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-card-title": {
              "color": "#570000"
            },
            ".mbr-desc": {
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#f7760c"
            }
          },
          "_name": "features4",
          "_sourceTheme": "resultm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features4 resultm5\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n        'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Item Amount\" name=\"cards\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\" selected>4</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Desc\" name=\"showDesc\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Button\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\" parallax selected>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#fc8f12\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#232323\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 card\">\n                <div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Shaping the Future of Building Communications</b></h2>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5 col-md-6 card\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-670x474.png\" alt=\"Working With Cell Carriers to Boost Your Connectivity\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Working With Cell Carriers to Boost Your Connectivity</b></h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\">Collaboration is key to our approach. We join forces with leading cell carriers, ensuring your DAS is expertly installed and fully equipped to work seamlessly with your current system. Get ready to experience unprecedented network strength and consistency, all thanks to the team at Viscom Systems.<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-danger-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            See more\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 1\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-670x670.png\" alt=\"Call Booster Systems: Empowering Your Communication\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Empowering Your Location</b></h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\">Our expert technicians are well-versed in installing Sure Call booster systems, enhancing your network's strength even further. With our dedication to quick, quality installations, you can rely on Viscom Systems to implement advanced technologies that can drastically improve your system's reach and reliability.<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-danger-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            See more\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 2\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-670x335.jpg\" alt=\"Comprehensive Headend, LMR, Fiber, and Cat 6 Installations\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Comprehensive Headend, LMR, Fiber, and Cat 6 Installations</b></h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\">\n                        At Viscom Systems, we do more than just install DAS systems - we build complete communications infrastructures. Our certified technicians are adept at Headend, LMR, Fiber, and Cat 6 installations, offering a comprehensive range of services to streamline your connectivity and support your operational efficiency.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-danger-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            See more\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 3\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-670x402.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Guaranteed Quality and Efficiency With Viscom Systems</b></h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\">We pride ourselves on delivering the best of both worlds: local, personalized service combined with industry-leading technology. Every project we undertake is backed by our commitment to quick and courteous service, ensuring your installations are completed on time and on budget.<br><br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-danger-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            See more\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
