          "_name": "features4",
          "_sourceTheme": "resultm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features4 resultm5\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n        'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Item Amount\" name=\"cards\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\" selected>4</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Desc\" name=\"showDesc\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Button\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-4-1920x1280.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#232323\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 card\">\n                <div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b><i>Your Reliable Partner for Communication Systems Services</i></b></h2>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5 col-md-6 card\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-687x1066.png\" alt=\"Systems Testing and Troubleshooting \">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">System Testing and Troubleshooting</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\">Whether you're facing a minor hiccup or a major system issue, our certified technicians are adept at diagnosing and resolving challenges in a timely manner. They bring expertise from our strategic partners to your doorstep, ensuring perfect deployments and fixes for your communications system. You can trust us to keep your infrastructure functioning at its peak.<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-danger-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            See more\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 1\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/p1107014-687x515.jpg\" alt=\"Comprehensive Housekeeping Tasks\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">Comprehensive Housekeeping Tasks</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\">At Viscom Systems, we believe in preventive maintenance. Our team will conduct regular system health checks, updates, and optimizations as part of our housekeeping tasks. With every visit, we'll provide you with thorough documentation detailing the actions taken and their implications, empowering you with full transparency.<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-danger-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            See more\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 2\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-1-687x458.jpg\" alt=\"Service Calls and Support\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">After-Hours and Holiday Service</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\">Your communication infrastructure doesn’t take a break, and neither do we. &nbsp;Our team understands the critical importance of keeping your systems up and running, which is why we offer service calls during after-hours, weekends, and even on holidays. With Viscom Systems, you're never alone. Our support is always just a call away.<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-danger-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            See more\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-5 col-md-6 card\" mbr-if=\"cards > 3\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/p1106993-687x916.jpg\" alt=\"Unmatched Quality Maintaining IT Infrastructure\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">Unmatched Quality Assurance</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\">Our strategic partnerships with multiple industry leading manufacturers in communication and IT products allows us to offer some of the best warranties in the industry. You can rest assured knowing your system is taken care of by a team that completes every project on time, on budget, and to your complete satisfaction.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-danger-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            See more\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "features4-2k",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "tJfT4vafIJ",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
